    <string name="help_dpad_desc">Ilova piktogrammalari panjarasi, yuqori sarlavhalar paneli, qidiruv paneli va maxsus toifadagi papkalar bo‘ylab harakatlaning.</string>
    <string name="help_long_press_title">OK / Tanlash tugmasini uzoq bosing</string>
    <string name="help_long_press_desc">Deep Stopni ishga tushirish, maxsus tezkor tugmalarni o\'rnatish yoki maxsus bannerlarni tahrirlash uchun Ilova kontekst menyusini ochadi.</string>
    <string name="help_settings_title">Menyu tugmasi / Sozlamalar belgisi</string>
    <string name="help_settings_desc">Launcher sozlamalarini ochadi (4K fon rasmi mexanizmi, maxsus urg\'u ranglari, unumdorlik keshini tozalash).</string>
    <string name="help_hotkey_title">Raqamli tugmalar (0 - 9)</string>
    <string name="help_hotkey_desc">Launcherning istalgan joyidan xaritalangan tezkor ilovalarni darhol ishga tushiradi.</string>
    <string name="help_vault_title">Stealth Vault Combo</string>
    <string name="help_vault_desc">Yashirin ombor ilovalarini qulfdan chiqarish yoki blokirovka qilish uchun D-Pad kombinatsiyasini bosing: YUQARI, YUQARI, PASHGA, CHAP.</string>
    <string name="help_mic_title">Mikrofon/yordamchi tugmasi</string>
    <string name="help_mic_desc">Qo\'llab-quvvatlanadigan Android TV pultlarida ovozli qidiruv tinglovchisini ishga tushiradi.</string>
    <string name="vault_title">Stealth Vault qulfini ochish</string>
    <string name="vault_desc">Kodni kiriting (standart: GHOST) yoki asosiy ekranda D-Pad ketma-ketligi UP, UP, DOWN, LEFT tugmasini bosing.</string>
    <string name="vault_invalid_passcode">Yaroqsiz parol</string>
    <string name="transparency_title">Ilovalarni ochish shaffofligi</string>
    <string name="transparency_desc">Aura TV oʻrnatilgan ilovalarni skanerlash uchun ruxsat talab qiladi (QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES). Bu qurilmangizdagi mahalliy TV ilovalari va yon yuklangan mobil ilovalarni avtomatik aniqlash va ko‘rsatish uchun zarur.

Aura TV 100% ochiq manba, reklamasiz va maxfiyligingizni hurmat qiladi. Hech qanday shaxsiy ma\'lumotlar yoki ilovalar ro\'yxati yig\'ilmaydi yoki uzatilmaydi.</string>
    <string name="transparency_accept">Men tushunaman va qabul qilaman</string>
    <string name="onboarding_welcome_title">Aura TV ga xush kelibsiz</string>
    <string name="onboarding_welcome_desc">Qulay navigatsiya, chuqur moslashtirish va toza estetika uchun moʻljallangan, yashin tezligida, minimalist Android TV ishga tushirgichi.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_cats_title">Smart ilovalar toifalari</string>
    <string name="onboarding_cats_desc">Oqimli ilovalar, o‘yinlar va yonma-yon yuklangan yordamchi dasturlarni jonli ilovalar soni bilan maxsus qator bo‘limlari sarlavhalarida tartiblang.</string>
    <string name="onboarding_oled_title">OLED yonib ketishdan himoya qilish</string>
    <string name="onboarding_oled_desc">OLED-xavfsiz qora ekranni avtomatik ravishda ishga tushiradigan sozlanishi mumkin bo\'lgan harakatsizlik taymerlari bilan televizor ekraningizni himoya qiling.</string>
    <string name="hotkey_dialog_title">Xarita tezkor tugmasi: %1$s</string>
    <string name="hotkey_dialog_desc">Ushbu ilovani darhol ishga tushirish uchun ishga tushirgichdagi masofaviy raqamli tugmachani (0-9) bosing.</string>
    <string name="category_dialog_title">Dinamik turkum: %1$s</string>
    <string name="category_dialog_desc">Mavjud toifadagi jildni tanlang yoki yangisini kiriting.</string>
    <string name="create_category_hint">Yangi jild nomi yaratish...</string>
    <string name="banner_dialog_title">Banner tuzatuvchisi: %1$s</string>
    <string name="banner_dialog_desc">Maxsus 16:9 banner uchun mahalliy fayl yoʻlini yoki rasm URL manzilini kiriting.
Maslahat: Avtomatik aniqlash uchun rasmlarni /sdcard/AuraTV/Banners/%1$s.png-ga saqlang.</string>
